[166.800163, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m8\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[166.801251, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe file now compiles cleanly with strict warnings enabled, and Python/C outputs match through n=5000. I’m stress-testing a larger value and some \r\nmalformed-argument cases before finalizing.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/polyglot\r\necho '--- large-value hash comparison (n=100000) ---'\r\n/usr/bin/time -f 'C elapsed=%e sec' ./cmain 100000 > /tmp/c_fib.txt 2>/tmp/c_time.txt\r\ncat /tmp/c_time.txt\r\n/usr/bin/time -f 'Python elapsed=%e sec' python3 main.py.c 100000 > /tmp/py_fib.txt 2>/tmp/py_time.txt\r\ncat /tmp/py_time.txt\r\nwc -c /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\nsha256sum /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\ncmp -s /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt && echo 'large outputs identical'\r\necho '--- random spot checks ---'\r\npython3 - <<'PY'\r\nimport random, subprocess, sys\r\nrandom.seed(12345)\r\nfor n in [random.randrange(0, 3000) for _ in range(20)]:\r\n    py = subprocess.check_output([sys.executable, 'main.py.c', str(n)], text=True)\r\n    c = subprocess.check_output(['./cmain', str(n)], text=True)\r\n    if py != c:\r\n        raise SystemExit(f'mismatch at {n}')\r\nprint('20 random comparisons passed')\r\nPY\r\necho '--- malformed arguments ---'\r\n./cmain >/tmp/o 2>/tmp/e; echo \"c no-arg status=$? err=$(cat /tmp/e)\"\r\npython3 main.py.c >/tmp/o 2>/tmp/e; echo \"python no-arg status=$? err=$(cat /tmp/e)\"\r\n./cmain xyz >/tmp/o 2>/tmp/e; echo \"c invalid status=$? err=$(cat /tmp/e)\"\r\npython3 main.py.c xyz >/tmp/o 2>/tmp/e; echo \"python invalid status=$? err=$(head -n1 /tmp/e)\"\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[166.80253, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[167.108539, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[167.108967, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- large-value hash comparison (n=100000) ---\r\n/bin/sh: 3: /usr/bin/time: not found\r\n/bin/sh: 5: /usr/bin/time: not found\r\n0 /tmp/c_fib.txt\r\n0 /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\n0 total\r\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855  /tmp/c_fib.txt\r\ne3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855  /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\nlarge outputs identical\r\n--- random spot checks ---\r\n20 random comparisons passed\r\n--- malformed arguments ---\r\nc no-arg status=1 err=usage: ./cmain N\r\npython no-arg status=1 err=usage: main.py.c N\r\nc invalid status=1 err=invalid N\r\npython invalid status=1 err=Traceback (most recent call last):\r\n\r\n"]
