[169.399813, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe environment lacks `/usr/bin/time`, so that run did not actually execute. I’ll rerun the large comparison using shell timestamps and verify the outputs are \r\nnon-empty and identical.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/polyglot\r\nstart=$(date +%s%N)\r\n./cmain 100000 > /tmp/c_fib.txt\r\ncend=$(date +%s%N)\r\nstartp=$(date +%s%N)\r\npython3 main.py.c 100000 > /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\npend=$(date +%s%N)\r\necho \"C ms=$(( (cend-start)/1000000 ))\"\r\necho \"Python ms=$(( (pend-startp)/1000000 ))\"\r\nwc -c /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\ncmp -s /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt && echo 'large outputs identical'\r\nsha256sum /tmp/c_fib.txt /tmp/py_fib.txt\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
